{"c":[{"name":"20261015T154954Z-18a69cbe885816c7","text":"Supersedes the checklist-gap note: the Add-a-model checklist now has the model AGENTS.md step. The root README lists no models on purpose; the directories are the list.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T155147Z-711ba3dd8db79ebf","text":"Do not test the Cults User-Agent string. Asserting the header, or that Python-urllib is absent, is a change detector.","type":"note"}]}
